; LAST HEARTH (the Ashen Wilds, 2026-09) - the survivors who came through the Breach and stayed.
;
; Authored in the settlement's CONTENT frame; tools/shift_cell_content.py placed it at the spec's
; content origin (metadata/content_offset) and moved the three schedules with it.
;
; THE LAYOUT: two roofless stone houses the survivors roofed with canvas, an open work shelter, a
; tent line along the west road and one fire. The west road from the arrival and the north road to
; the Hunters' station meet at the fire's edge; nothing stands within six metres of either.
;   the fire        (6, 9)  - Maeve Ashby, the headwoman, keeps it
;   the counter     (-13, 8) - Tobin Rusk, the scavenger (shop.last_hearth.scavenger), faces the road
;   the shelter     (12, -12) - where Ada Voss, the mender, keeps the sick
;   the waystone    (8, -3) - travel.ashen_wilds.last_hearth
;
; WARNING EVERYTHING STATIC PARENTS TO Nav; the people, the waystone and the fire do not.
